[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Stoat are short-legged omnivores, distant relative to [[Otter]] and [[Badger]].

Likes to hunt Rabbits. <!--(?:Chickens,Squirrels)-->

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Passive until you attack them. 

====Combat Moves====

{| class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed"
! Attacks<small>:2</small>
! Restorations<small>:1</small>&nbsp;
|- style="vertical-align: top;"
| {{:Fell Scratch}} {{:Chomp}}
| {{:Careful Approach}}
|}

===Strategy===

You'll need an horse with full stamina to catch them if they start running, because only horses on 4th speed can catch up to a stoat. 

==Notes==

*During winter, Stoats become white, and instead of [[Stoat Hide]] can be skinned for [[Ermine]] - ingredient for the [[Ermine Trimming]] gilding.

